{
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T19:51:13",
      "utterance": "こんばんは。今日はよろしくお願いいたします。",
      "tag": "Greeting"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T19:51:27",
      "utterance": "よろしくお願い致します。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T19:52:26",
      "utterance": "お時間になりましたら始めさせたいただきます。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T19:52:40",
      "utterance": "ありがとうございます。承知しました。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:00:23",
      "utterance": "こんばんは、相談員です。始めに年齢と性別を教えてください。",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:00:41",
      "utterance": "25歳　女性",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:00:56",
      "utterance": "ありがとうございます。今日のご相談内容を教えてください。",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:01:16",
      "utterance": "母のことについて",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。お母様のどのようなことでお悩みなのですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:01:59"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:02:22",
      "utterance": "いつも自分を頼ってきて",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:02:26",
      "utterance": "嫌です",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:03:18",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね、ご相談者様をお母様は頼られているのですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:03:43",
      "utterance": "まあ、はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:04:11",
      "utterance": "お母様は今おいくつなのですか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:04:26",
      "utterance": "50歳です",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:06:08",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。いつからお母様はご相談者様を頼られているのですか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:06:26",
      "utterance": "小さい頃から",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:07:11",
      "utterance": "なるほど、それはかなり長く頼られてきたのですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:07:36",
      "utterance": "もう疲れてます",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:08:39",
      "utterance": "離れて暮らしているのに",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:09:02",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね、それは疲れると思います。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:09:57",
      "utterance": "これってAIですか？",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:10:24",
      "utterance": "ちがいます。大変失礼いたしました。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:10:33",
      "utterance": "わかりました",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:11:22",
      "utterance": "お母様のことを今まで誰かにお話しされたことはありますか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:11:46",
      "utterance": "うーん",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:12:01",
      "utterance": "話した事はあるけど",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:12:11",
      "utterance": "わかってもらえなかった",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:13:07",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですね。ご自身としては分かってもらえなくてお辛かったですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:13:27",
      "utterance": "もう嫌なんです",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:15:05",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね、頼られるというの具体的にどのようなことを頼られるのですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:15:23",
      "utterance": "お金の無心とか",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:15:40",
      "utterance": "いきなり呼びつけるとか",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:16:07",
      "utterance": "いろいろあります",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:16:26",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね、ご相談者様のことを考えていただけないのですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:17:28",
      "utterance": "ご相談者様のご親族にお話はされましたか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:17:32",
      "utterance": "考えてないからできるんじゃないんですか",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:17:41",
      "utterance": "親族って？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:18:16",
      "utterance": "ご家族です。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:18:35",
      "utterance": "話したってわかってくれない",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:18:44",
      "utterance": "ずっとそうだから",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:19:35",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね、それは一人で抱え込んでいらした、ということでしょうか？",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:20:32",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:21:35",
      "utterance": "なるほど、よくおひとりで頑張られてこられましね。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:22:13",
      "utterance": "はい・・・",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:25:06",
      "utterance": "ご相談者はこれからどのようにお母様と接していきたい、とお考えですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:26:10",
      "utterance": "離れたいけど",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:27:22",
      "utterance": "なるほど、そうなのですね。でもお母様はそうはならない、ともお考えなのでしょうか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:27:28",
      "utterance": "もう一人で暮らしているし",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:27:43",
      "utterance": "無理な気がする",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:29:29",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね、でもお母様はまだ50歳ですよね。お元気だと思いますが。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:29:47",
      "utterance": "病気だから",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:30:39",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですね。それは悩まれますよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:32:18",
      "utterance": "行政などに相談したことはありますか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:32:29",
      "utterance": "ないです",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:32:41",
      "utterance": "ここって話を聞いてくれるんじゃないんですか？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:33:32",
      "utterance": "はい、ご相談者様のお話をお聞きします。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:35:26",
      "utterance": "お母様は今どのような状態なのですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:35:37",
      "utterance": "家事もできないし",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:35:46",
      "utterance": "通院しています",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:35:55",
      "utterance": "精神の病気なので",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:36:24",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね、それでご相談者様に頼られているのですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:36:36",
      "utterance": "でも限界です",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:38:38",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね、でもそんなにつらくてもお母様は行政などに頼らずに、このまま頑張っておひとりで見ていくおつもりなのですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:39:03",
      "utterance": "だからここに来ています",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:39:40",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね、それはありがとうございます。",
      "tag": "Thanking"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:41:05",
      "utterance": "でも相談員はご相談者様のお体と心のことを考えても、どなたかに助けていただいたほうがいいと思いますが、いかかですか？",
      "tag": "Suggest"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:41:25",
      "utterance": "家族も見て見ぬふりだし",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:41:34",
      "utterance": "父も弟も",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:42:43",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですね。ご家族はお母様と別に暮らしていらっしゃるのでしょうか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:42:56",
      "utterance": "いえ、一緒に暮らしています",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:43:04",
      "utterance": "私は離れたので",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:44:21",
      "utterance": "なるほど、そういうことなのですね。ご家族はなぜご一緒に暮らしているお母様に関心がないのですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:45:07",
      "utterance": "私がやるものだと思っているから",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:46:49",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね、ご長女であるご相談者様にみなさんも頼られている、ということなのですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:47:33",
      "utterance": "そうやってみんな言ってくる",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:47:55",
      "utterance": "親孝行な娘とか言われたら、どこにも話せないですよ",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:48:53",
      "utterance": "なるほど、そうだったのですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:49:47",
      "utterance": "ご自身としてもそういわれていたら、助けないわけにはいかないですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:51:01",
      "utterance": "でも限度を越しています",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:51:35",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね、本当にお辛いですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:53:30",
      "utterance": "お一人で暮らしていられるとおっしゃいましたが、何かリラックスできることなどは考えたことはございますか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:54:31",
      "utterance": "いつも不安で",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:55:19",
      "utterance": "母、職場にきた事もあったし",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:55:27",
      "utterance": "怖いんです",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:56:28",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね、離れているご相談者様のお宅まで来られるんですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:56:37",
      "utterance": "職場です",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:56:41",
      "utterance": "私の",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:57:04",
      "utterance": "迷惑かかるから仕事も辞めたんです",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:57:58",
      "utterance": "そうだったんですね、それでは今はお仕事をされていないのですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:58:27",
      "utterance": "転職しました",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T20:58:56",
      "utterance": "今の職場の場所は母に言っていません",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T21:00:55",
      "utterance": "もう少しお話をお聞きしたいのですが、お時間が来てしまいました。またいつでも待ちしています。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T21:01:09",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T21:01:21",
      "utterance": "お辛かったらいつでもいらしてくださいね。",
      "tag": "Suggest"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T21:01:32",
      "utterance": "わかりました",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T21:01:59",
      "utterance": "（とても勉強になりました。）ありがとうございました。",
      "tag": "Thanking"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T21:02:26",
      "utterance": "（ありがとうございました。お疲れ様でした。）",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T21:02:57",
      "utterance": "それではこれで終わらせていただきます。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-01-19T21:03:09",
      "utterance": "（わかりました。あとからコメントさせていただきますね。）",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-01-19T21:03:37",
      "utterance": "（よろしくお願いします！）",
      "tag": "Other"
    }
  ],
